# Transactional fact tables

## One row per **event**

- Written the moment it happens — one order line, one click, one payment
- The **finest, most atomic** grain — the warehouse workhorse

## Insert-only, 1:1 with the source

- Rows are **never updated** — the event is immutable
- 240 source orders → **240** fact rows

## Mostly additive → endlessly flexible

- `quantity`, `line_total` roll up to **any** summary
- Keeps **every event** for questions not yet asked

## The default

- Reach for other fact types only when a **specific need** appears
